sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuário
    participant FE as SPA (React)
    participant SC as SapContext
    participant EF as Edge Function<br/>sap-proxy
    participant CRED as system_credentials<br/>(Postgres)
    participant SL as SAP B1<br/>Service Layer
    participant DB as Postgres<br/>(cache + audit)

    U->>FE: Login SAP (empresa + usuário + senha)
    FE->>EF: invoke sap-login
    EF->>CRED: SELECT credenciais (RLS)
    EF->>SL: POST /Login {CompanyDB, UserName, Password}
    SL-->>EF: SessionId + Cookie B1SESSION
    EF->>DB: audit_log(action=sap_login)
    EF-->>FE: session {companyDB, sessionId}
    FE->>SC: setSession()

    U->>FE: Aprovar documento
    FE->>EF: invoke sap-approve {docEntry, session}
    EF->>SL: GET /DraftDocuments(docEntry)<br/>Cookie: B1SESSION
    SL-->>EF: draft payload
    EF->>SL: PATCH /Drafts(docEntry) {Approved:true}
    SL-->>EF: 204 No Content
    EF->>DB: INSERT approval_history + audit_log
    EF-->>FE: ok
    FE-->>U: Toast sucesso

    Note over EF,SL: Erros → sap-error.ts normaliza<br/>e retorna código traduzido
